# `.lens/` is this app's build input: snapshots, the Ask evidence bundle and the
# research evidence package, all produced by the Python engine. It is not
# committed, because it is reproducible -- but a preview that builds from this
# directory alone cannot reproduce it, so it is uploaded and the build is told
# to keep it with LENS_USE_STAGED.
